842
01:21:43.690 --> 01:21:44.774
You can't escape death.

843
01:21:56.703 --> 01:21:57.996
Aah.

844
01:21:58.914 --> 01:21:59.915
You are death.

845
01:22:02.876 --> 01:22:03.877
